{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901025150010","name":"甜花","text":"え……\r\nにぶんのいち……ってこと……？","trans":"诶……\n是二分之一的……意思……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……そういうことだな……","trans":"……就是这个意思吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025150020","name":"甜花","text":"え、えと……\r\nどうしよ……どっちかな……","trans":"那、那个……\n怎么办……是哪个呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025150030","name":"甜花","text":"プロデューサーさん……\r\n先に、選んで……","trans":"制作人……\n先、选吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………！\r\nす、すっぱ…………！？","trans":"…………！\n好、好酸…………！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025150070","name":"甜花","text":"だ、大丈夫……？\r\nこれ、水……飲んで……！","trans":"没、没事吧……？\n这个，水……快喝……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"プロデューサー","text":"あ、ああ……\r\nありがとう、甜花──","trans":"啊，嗯……\n谢谢你，甜花——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025150080","name":"甜花","text":"──あ、でも…………","trans":"——啊，可是…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-24","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………\r\nうん、甘いな……","trans":"…………\n嗯，是甜的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025150040","name":"甜花","text":"ひぃ…………っ！","trans":"咿…………！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-26","name":"プロデューサー","text":"だ、大丈夫か甜花！？","trans":"没、没事吧甜花！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-27","name":"プロデューサー","text":"口直しの何か、持ってくるよ\r\n水でいいか……！？","trans":"我去拿点换口味的东西\n水可以吗……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025150050","name":"甜花","text":"……げほっ\r\nう、うん……","trans":"……咳\n嗯、嗯……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025150060","name":"甜花","text":"あと……甘いケーキも……\r\nお願い……","trans":"还有……甜蛋糕也……\n拜托……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}